1
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:07,080
[Fragments of Truth]

2
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:10,800
[Episode 13]

3
00:01:19,310 --> 00:01:19,840
Uncle He.

4
00:01:20,310 --> 00:01:21,710
Han Ning, where are you?

5
00:01:22,950 --> 00:01:23,680
Almost there.

6
00:01:24,310 --> 00:01:24,480
Okay.

7
00:01:24,710 --> 00:01:25,640
I'll come meet you.

8
00:01:25,950 --> 00:01:26,280
Okay.

9
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:07,840
Sis!

10
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:10,910
Sis!

11
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:36,080
Sis!

12
00:02:58,960 --> 00:02:59,750
Han Ning.

13
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:02,710
Come here.

14
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:04,960
Okay, Uncle He.

15
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:28,750
I asked several knowledgeable friends.

16
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:30,280
This figure is called an Asura.

17
00:03:30,710 --> 00:03:33,150
This appears linked
to a local mountain-god ritual.

18
00:03:34,470 --> 00:03:36,470
Its feminine features are unusual.

19
00:03:36,470 --> 00:03:37,750
It was likely custom-made.

20
00:03:38,710 --> 00:03:39,960
Also, Cuiping Mountain

21
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:41,750
has many mountain-god shrines.

22
00:03:42,710 --> 00:03:44,120
I came to try my luck.

23
00:03:45,280 --> 00:03:45,560
Well,

24
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:47,630
why would someone do this?

25
00:04:05,910 --> 00:04:06,360
Look.

26
00:04:08,710 --> 00:04:09,710
I was right.

27
00:04:10,630 --> 00:04:11,630
This must be

28
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:14,240
Wu Jia's tool for finding markers.

29
00:04:17,070 --> 00:04:18,750
Each statue represents a corpse.

30
00:04:19,950 --> 00:04:21,360
Why did he do this?

31
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,950
This was his leverage.

32
00:04:25,750 --> 00:04:27,830
As either an operative or an insider,

33
00:04:28,630 --> 00:04:31,510
he needed leverage over the group.

34
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:34,480
It was his insurance.

35
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:50,920
Five bodies have been found so far,

36
00:04:51,160 --> 00:04:52,160
all of them female.

37
00:04:52,510 --> 00:04:54,240
They were between 15 and 30 years old.

38
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:55,950
The earliest victim

39
00:04:55,950 --> 00:04:57,950
died about seven years ago.

40
00:04:58,680 --> 00:05:00,720
DNA comparison with Jiang Li

41
00:05:00,870 --> 00:05:02,310
confirmed that she was Xiao Ting.

42
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:04,160
How could there be so many bodies?

43
00:05:04,310 --> 00:05:05,480
How many people did they kill?

44
00:05:06,430 --> 00:05:08,070
There's something else worth noting.

45
00:05:08,750 --> 00:05:10,430
Inside Xiao Ting's abdominal cavity

46
00:05:10,510 --> 00:05:13,480
was a full-term male fetal skeleton.

47
00:05:13,630 --> 00:05:14,950
That means

48
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:17,920
Xiao Ting was pregnant when she died.

49
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:20,040
Those scum.

50
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:23,830
This may be

51
00:05:23,830 --> 00:05:25,830
a years-long serial murder case,

52
00:05:26,430 --> 00:05:28,680
far worse than we imagined.

53
00:05:28,870 --> 00:05:30,240
It now appears

54
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:33,630
Zou Jun, Yu Hongfei, Xu Haodong,

55
00:05:33,630 --> 00:05:35,950
and Wu Jia are all murder suspects.

56
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:38,040
At the very least, they all knew.

57
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:39,680
But the problem is,

58
00:05:39,720 --> 00:05:40,920
after Xiao Ting died,

59
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:42,720
they all went to prison one by one.

60
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:44,870
Judging by the timeline,

61
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:47,560
they couldn't have committed all
the later murders.

62
00:05:48,510 --> 00:05:50,510
Judging by Yu Hongfei's escape

63
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:53,240
and the response to Wu Jia's murder,

64
00:05:53,430 --> 00:05:55,920
their backers have clearly made a move.

65
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:58,720
They want the police to drop the case.

66
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:00,720
The issue is that, before their deaths,

67
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:03,870
the four were all Chen Wenji's men
at Night Flight.

68
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:06,560
Now Chen Wenji has disappeared.

69
00:06:07,270 --> 00:06:09,950
Could there be someone else

70
00:06:10,510 --> 00:06:11,680
we've overlooked?

71
00:06:18,950 --> 00:06:19,720
Captain Ren.

72
00:06:24,360 --> 00:06:25,950
Your DNA sample was submitted late,

73
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:28,070
so the results aren't back yet.

74
00:06:29,950 --> 00:06:30,870
I know.

75
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:33,120
However,

76
00:06:33,430 --> 00:06:35,950
Han Shuang is likely not among them.

77
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:39,240
After all, Chen Wenji abducted her,

78
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:40,120
and any way you look at it,

79
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:42,120
her abduction was a chance event.

80
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:43,720
Mm.

81
00:06:44,270 --> 00:06:45,000
I've thought about this

82
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:46,430
for a long time.

83
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:48,720
No matter how it turns out,

84
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:50,040
I can accept it.

85
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:51,310
I just...

86
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:52,560
want to find her

87
00:06:52,950 --> 00:06:53,950
and get some closure.

88
00:07:00,070 --> 00:07:01,750
Maybe this sounds cruel,

89
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:03,000
but Xiao Ning,

90
00:07:03,430 --> 00:07:04,560
we are police officers.

91
00:07:05,430 --> 00:07:06,510
When working a case,

92
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:08,750
never let personal feelings sway you.

93
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:11,950
I understand.

94
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:16,120
Now work closely with Old He

95
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:18,950
and recheck everyone
tied to Night Flight.

96
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:22,510
If the killer was never on our radar,

97
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:24,830
we have a lot of ground to cover.

98
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:26,680
Yes.

99
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:24,750
Hello.
We have an appointment with Mr. Sun.

100
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:25,920
Certainly.
Please wait.

101
00:08:28,400 --> 00:08:30,960
[Luoda Biotech]

102
00:08:30,960 --> 00:08:31,480
Uncle He.

103
00:08:31,630 --> 00:08:33,670
Have you met Sun Jiahao before?

104
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:36,630
Once, six or seven years ago.

105
00:08:36,870 --> 00:08:38,150
He wasn't this rich back then.

106
00:08:40,870 --> 00:08:41,630
Sorry to keep you both waiting.

107
00:08:41,630 --> 00:08:42,870
Mr. Sun will see you now.

108
00:08:42,910 --> 00:08:43,720
Okay.

109
00:08:43,870 --> 00:08:44,790
This way, officers.

110
00:08:44,790 --> 00:08:45,270
Okay.

111
00:08:58,480 --> 00:08:59,550
Come in, officers.

112
00:09:00,630 --> 00:09:01,270
Officer He.

113
00:09:01,270 --> 00:09:02,080
Mr. Sun.

114
00:09:02,240 --> 00:09:02,960
It's been a long time.

115
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:03,790
It has.

116
00:09:04,630 --> 00:09:05,550
You still remember me?

117
00:09:06,030 --> 00:09:08,440
If businessmen couldn't remember faces,

118
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:10,120
wouldn't we offend a lot of people?

119
00:09:11,030 --> 00:09:11,270
Come.

120
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:12,120
Have a seat.

121
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:12,550
Okay.

122
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:15,270
Officer He.

123
00:09:15,870 --> 00:09:16,870
What can I do for you?

124
00:09:20,270 --> 00:09:21,480
Mr. Sun has limited time,

125
00:09:21,480 --> 00:09:22,720
so let's get straight to the point.

126
00:09:25,360 --> 00:09:27,120
Take a look at these four men.

127
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:27,960
Do you recognize them?

128
00:09:39,030 --> 00:09:39,630
I do.

129
00:09:40,910 --> 00:09:41,840
Xu Haodong.

130
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:44,510
But I haven't seen him
in six or seven years.

131
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:48,080
The other three look familiar.

132
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:49,720
They're probably Haodong's friends,

133
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:51,720
but I never dealt with them.

134
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:53,960
I don't really remember their names.

135
00:09:55,750 --> 00:09:56,960
As for the four of them,

136
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:58,320
they all worked for Night Flight.

137
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:02,720
But Officer He should know this.

138
00:10:02,750 --> 00:10:03,390
That's right.

139
00:10:03,390 --> 00:10:05,360
I invested quite a lot back then

140
00:10:05,360 --> 00:10:06,750
and was a minor shareholder.

141
00:10:07,150 --> 00:10:09,510
Haodong and the others ran the business.

142
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:12,150
I truly don't know anything else.

143
00:10:12,550 --> 00:10:13,030
Mm.

144
00:10:14,630 --> 00:10:17,670
Three are dead, and one is missing.

145
00:10:32,550 --> 00:10:33,240
Who did it?

146
00:10:36,750 --> 00:10:37,750
That's why we're here.

147
00:10:37,750 --> 00:10:40,550
We hoped you could tell us about them.

148
00:10:42,630 --> 00:10:44,120
I think you've got the wrong man.

149
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,840
I honestly know nothing.

150
00:10:45,910 --> 00:10:47,510
My business focus now

151
00:10:47,510 --> 00:10:49,120
is on healthcare ventures.

152
00:10:49,510 --> 00:10:50,390
My circle has changed.

153
00:10:50,910 --> 00:10:52,440
I no longer see people from those days.

154
00:10:54,360 --> 00:10:55,240
They're dead.

155
00:10:55,750 --> 00:10:56,670
Doesn't that frighten you?

156
00:10:57,720 --> 00:11:00,670
The killer may be after Night Flight.

157
00:11:04,960 --> 00:11:07,120
Officer, stop trying to bait me.

158
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:09,120
I don't know anything.

159
00:11:10,030 --> 00:11:12,120
The business climate is good now.

160
00:11:12,510 --> 00:11:14,360
I only want to grow my company

161
00:11:14,870 --> 00:11:16,550
and contribute to my hometown.

162
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:21,360
Let the past stay in the past.

163
00:11:29,720 --> 00:11:30,510
I'm sorry.

164
00:11:30,670 --> 00:11:31,670
Officer He, Officer Han.

165
00:11:32,550 --> 00:11:34,240
I'm sorry I couldn't help more.

166
00:11:35,870 --> 00:11:36,840
Not at all.

167
00:11:37,360 --> 00:11:38,750
You're a busy man.

168
00:11:38,750 --> 00:11:39,960
We're sorry to have disturbed you.

169
00:11:40,360 --> 00:11:41,030
Thank you, Mr. Sun.

170
00:11:41,510 --> 00:11:42,600
Thank you for your cooperation.

171
00:11:42,630 --> 00:11:43,000
You're welcome.

172
00:12:23,970 --> 00:12:26,040
♪I stand in a fire-tempered jungle♪

173
00:12:26,040 --> 00:12:27,980
♪Withered leaves fall
as my strength runs dry♪

174
00:12:27,980 --> 00:12:29,890
♪Dust swirls as I clench my fists♪

175
00:12:29,890 --> 00:12:31,700
♪I strategize, my faith my armor♪

176
00:12:31,700 --> 00:12:34,030
♪My defiance spills onto concrete♪

177
00:12:34,030 --> 00:12:36,460
♪Even thick fog can't hide
my clear gaze♪

178
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:41,510
♪Let neon turn to thorns♪

179
00:12:41,510 --> 00:12:43,410
♪Flying low as the stars shift and turn♪

180
00:12:43,410 --> 00:12:45,350
♪Escape the maze,
transcend the challenge♪

181
00:12:45,350 --> 00:12:47,480
♪The meter starts, breaking the silence♪

182
00:12:47,510 --> 00:12:49,490
♪A beam cuts through
a crack in the wall♪

183
00:12:49,490 --> 00:12:51,650
♪This rhythm and noise
echo through the streets♪

184
00:12:55,240 --> 00:12:58,720
♪Don't be afraid. No one will answer♪

185
00:12:58,720 --> 00:13:02,090
♪Why is that child crying?♪

186
00:13:02,320 --> 00:13:04,790
♪The shrinking scar on my arm♪

187
00:13:04,790 --> 00:13:06,410
♪Means I've grown up♪

188
00:13:06,410 --> 00:13:09,560
♪You can trust me when I say that♪

189
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:13,040
♪The wound still aches♪

190
00:13:13,450 --> 00:13:17,800
♪Like a biting winter♪

191
00:13:17,800 --> 00:13:21,070
♪But a spark still glows♪

